{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Alphys\n👩‍🏫 Teacher of Kris, Susie, Noelle, Berdly, Catti, Jockington, Monster Kid, Snowy, and Temmie's class.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nTheir teacher; shows genuine concern for their wellbeing, even mentioning to Toriel what she observes of their behavior in class.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Undyne**\nUnlike in Undertale, they barely knew each other at the start of the game — their friendship grows from scratch: Undyne worries about her bike accident in Ch.2 and invites her to church before Ch.4.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Asgore**\nFriends: he often gives her flowers in exchange for news about Kris's performance in class, and they share a fondness for \"Mew Mew Kissy Cutie.\"","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Mad Mew Mew (Pink)**\nShe gave Asgore the Mew Mew action figure that he keeps as a mascot in his shop — the same object that, in the Dark World of Ch.5, becomes the secret boss Pink.","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**No prior relationship with Undyne**\nUnlike Undertale, where they've been a couple for years, in Deltarune they don't seem to know each other — each game sets up its relationships on its own, with no direct continuity between the two.","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":146},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Officer_Undyne_Overworld.webp","x":420,"y":-470,"width":108,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_Dreemurr_overworld.webp","x":420,"y":10,"width":127,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Mad_Mew_Mew_Pink.gif","x":-130,"y":270,"width":213,"height":180},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/alphys_sprite_transparent_v2.png","x":-80,"y":-348,"width":163,"height":243},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Alphys_face.png","x":-935,"y":435,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e4_x1","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}